### Obtener tutor por id
GET {{host}}/tutors/{{tutorId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Obtener estudiantes asignados a un tutor
GET {{host}}/tutors/{{tutorId}}/students
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Crear tutor
POST {{host}}/tutors
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Carlos Ramirez",
  "email": "carlos.gabriel@example.com",
  "passwordHash": "TutorPass123",
  "country": "CO",
  "gender": "M",
  "age": 35,
  "degree": "Maestria"
}



### Actualizar tutor
PUT {{host}}/tutors/{{tutorId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": " Actualizado nuevamente",
  "email": "sethasasaso@example.com",
  "role": "tutor",
  "country": "MX",
  "gender": "M",
  "age": 19,
  "degree": "maestria"
}

### Eliminar tutor

### Asignar tutor a estudiante por email
POST {{host}}/tutors/assign-student
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentEmail": "ana.student@example.com",
  "tutorEmail": "sethasasaso@example.com"
}

### Eliminar tutor
DELETE {{host}}/tutors/{{tutorId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
